_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(X,Y\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\rm tt}\">\\(\\le_{\\rm tt}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"84713a230dd071da\" href=\"?note=84713a230dd071da\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-trivial\">43-df-schnorr-trivial</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"57ebf9aa27784e60\" href=\"?note=57ebf9aa27784e60\" title=\"43-df-tt\">43-df-tt</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}(Y)\\land X\\le_{\\rm tt}Y\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}(Y)\\land X\\le_{\\rm tt}Y\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一tt程序对所有oracle停机使模拟后的机器保持可计算域测度。此结论未升级为Turing向下闭合，也未把原稿Question 16.3.12的直和闭合问题升级为定理。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 16.3.11; printed p.500 / PDF p.520。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-schnorr-trivial","status":"resolved","id":"84713a230dd071da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-tt","status":"resolved","id":"57ebf9aa27784e60","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · 